📊 Interactive Visualizations

This project includes two interactive map visualizations of U.S. airline route data, highlighting key origin and destination airports based on 2015 passenger volume.

🌐 1. Folium Map – Origin Airports
An interactive leaflet map displaying major origin cities, with circle sizes proportional to passenger volume.

👉 Open Folium Map
(Download and open in your browser)

🗺️ 2. Bokeh Map – Origin & Destination Airports
A Web Mercator-projected map with:

🔵 Blue circles representing origin airports
🔴 Red circles representing destination airports
🧭 Hover tool showing city names and total passengers
👉 Open Bokeh Map
